  "code": "---\ntitle: Label\ndesc: Label is used to provide a name or title for an input field. Label can be placed before or after the field.\nsource: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/saadeghi/daisyui/refs/heads/master/packages/daisyui/src/components/label.css\nlayout: components\nclassnames:\n  component:\n  - class: label\n    desc: For styling the text next to an input field (or select)\n  - class: floating-label\n    desc: For the parent of an input field (or select) and a span that floats above the input field when the field is focused\n---\n\n<script>\n  import Component from \"$components/Component.svelte\"\n  import Translate from \"$components/Translate.svelte\"\n</script>\n\n### ~Label for input\n<label class=\"input\">\n  <span class=\"label\">https://</span>\n  <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"URL\" />\n</label>\n\n```html\n<label class=\"$$input\">\n  <span class=\"$$label\">https://</span>\n  <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"URL\" />\n</label>\n```\n### ~Label for input at the end\n<label class=\"input\">\n  <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"domain name\" />\n  <span class=\"label\">.com</span>\n</label>\n\n```html\n<label class=\"$$input\">\n  <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"domain name\" />\n  <span class=\"$$label\">.com</span>\n</label>\n```\n\n### ~Label for select\n<label class=\"select\">\n  <span class=\"label\">Type</span>\n  <select>\n    <option>Personal</option>\n    <option>Business</option>\n  </select>\n</label>\n\n```html\n<label class=\"$$select\">\n  <span class=\"$$label\">Type</span>\n  <select>\n    <option>Personal</option>\n    <option>Business</option>\n  </select>\n</label>\n```\n\n### ~Label for date input\n<label class=\"input\">\n  <span class=\"label\">Publish date</span>\n  <input type=\"date\" />\n</label>\n\n```html\n<label class=\"$$input\">\n  <span class=\"$$label\">Publish date</span>\n  <input type=\"date\" />\n</label>\n```\n\n\n\n### ~Floating Label\n<label class=\"floating-label w-full max-w-xs\">\n  <span>Your Email</span>\n  <input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"mail@site.com\" class=\"input input-md\" />\n</label>\n\n```html\n<label class=\"$$floating-label\">\n  <span>Your Email</span>\n  <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"mail@site.com\" class=\"$$input $$input-md\" />\n</label>\n```\n\n### ~Floating Label with Different Sizes\n<div class=\"grid gap-4 w-xs\">\n  <label class=\"floating-label\">\n    <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Extra Small\" class=\"input input-xs\" />\n    <span>Extra Small</span>\n  </label>\n  <label class=\"floating-label\">\n    <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Small\" class=\"input input-sm\" />\n    <span>Small</span>\n  </label>\n  <label class=\"floating-label\">\n    <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Medium\" class=\"input input-md\" />\n    <span>Medium</span>\n  </label>\n  <label class=\"floating-label\">\n    <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Large\" class=\"input input-lg\" />\n    <span>Large</span>\n  </label>\n  <label class=\"floating-label\">\n    <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Extra Large\" class=\"input input-xl\" />\n    <span>Extra Large</span>\n  </label>\n</div>\n\n```html\n<label class=\"$$floating-label\">\n  <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Extra Small\" class=\"$$input $$input-xs\" />\n  <span>Extra Small</span>\n</label>\n<label class=\"$$floating-label\">\n  <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Small\" class=\"$$input $$input-sm\" />\n  <span>Small</span>\n</label>\n<label class=\"$$floating-label\">\n  <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Medium\" class=\"$$input $$input-md\" />\n  <span>Medium</span>\n</label>\n<label class=\"$$floating-label\">\n  <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Large\" class=\"$$input $$input-lg\" />\n  <span>Large</span>\n</label>\n<label class=\"$$floating-label\">\n  <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Extra Large\" class=\"$$input $$input-xl\" />\n  <span>Extra Large</span>\n</label>\n```\n\n### ~Responsive Size Floating Label\n<div class=\"grid gap-4 w-xs\">\n  <label class=\"floating-label\">\n    <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Input\" class=\"input input-xs sm:input-sm md:input-md lg:input-lg xl:input-xl\" value=\"Placeholder\" />\n    <span>Input</span>\n  </label>\n\n  <label class=\"floating-label\">\n    <textarea placeholder=\"Textarea\" class=\"textarea textarea-xs sm:textarea-sm md:textarea-md lg:textarea-lg xl:textarea-xl\">Placeholder</textarea>\n    <span>Textarea</span>\n  </label>\n\n  <label class=\"floating-label\">\n    <select class=\"select select-xs sm:select-sm md:select-md lg:select-lg xl:select-xl\">\n      <option disabled selected>Placeholder</option>\n      <option>Option</option>\n    </select>\n    <span>Select</span>\n  </label>\n</div>\n\n```html\n<label class=\"$$floating-label\">\n  <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Input\" class=\"$$input $$input-xs sm:$$input-sm md:$$input-md lg:$$input-lg xl:$$input-xl\" value=\"Placeholder\" />\n  <span>Input</span>\n</label>\n\n<label class=\"$$floating-label\">\n  <textarea placeholder=\"Textarea\" class=\"$$textarea $$textarea-xs sm:$$textarea-sm md:$$textarea-md lg:$$textarea-lg xl:$$textarea-xl\">Placeholder</textarea>\n  <span>Textarea</span>\n</label>\n\n<label class=\"$$floating-label\">\n  <select class=\"$$select $$select-xs sm:$$select-sm md:$$select-md lg:$$select-lg xl:$$select-xl\">\n    <option disabled selected>Placeholder</option>\n    <option>Option</option>\n  </select>\n  <span>Select</span>\n</label>\n```\n",
